00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:12.140
Like you will get different prices for airline
tickets based on what the airline server knows

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:16.830
about you based on the browser and the computer
that you're using, right? If you're like trying

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:21.140
to buy these tickets with a browser that carries
information on it, that suggests that using

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:26.030
a more expensive computer you have more money
to work with, you're going to get a different

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:31.200
price. Imagine that applied more generally
