00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:36.560
where the platform has the payment platform
has sweetheart deals with other companies,

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:40.680
which when we look at something like Libra,
when we looked at something like all the various

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:46.530
