00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:48.130
to bitcoin or some of the other current cryptocurrencies
specifically, do these seem like these are

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:52.880
going to be the longterm replacements for
cash or do they seem more like intermediate

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:57.690
