00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:10.360
bet, I think we're entering an era of much
more diverse forms and types of money. Um,

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:15.529
I think we're going to see not a sort of one
ring to rule them all, you know, single fixed

00:12:15.529 --> 00:12:19.440
solution that replaces everything. Instead
we're going to see a proliferation of different

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:26.150
kinds of vehicles, um, that can range from,
well to put it in, in actually very straightforward

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:29.370
terms we can all relate to. We're already
starting to live in that world because we're

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:33.920
starting to live in a world that's shaped
so much by points, right? Like so many of

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:41.230
us are now used to the idea that we have cards
