00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:45.450
value on them, some of which can be redeemed
for cash, some of which can be redeemed from

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:49.461
miles, some of which can be redeemed from
minutes depending on what country you're in

00:12:49.461 --> 00:12:55.311
and what circumstances you're under. So what
we are already kind of surrounded by is a

00:12:55.311 --> 00:13:00.170
much more diverse money system that we don't
necessarily think of as being diverse than

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:05.060
just cash and credit. And that's just going
