00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:10.390
a lot more specialized types of money and
types of currency for different populations

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:14.650
and different groups. Um, so it's going to
be really interesting to see how that plays

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:19.440
out because I suspect that we will start to
understand ourselves as living in an ecosystem

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:20.440
of money.

